        <PageObject XPosition="134.015748031496" YPosition="175.905511811024" OwnPage="0" ItemID="1264445929" ItemType="4" Width="527.244094488189" Height="21.259842519685" FrameType="0" ClipEdited="0" LineWidth="1" LinePenStyle="1" ImageScaleX="1" ImageScaleY="1" ImageOffsetX="0" ImageOffsetY="0" ImageRotation="0" ImageVisible="1" ImageScaleType="1" ImageRatio="1" Columns="1" ColumnGap="0" AutomaticTextFrame="0" TextToFrameDistanceLeft="0" TextToFrameDistanceTop="0" TextToFrameDistanceBottom="0" TextToFrameDistanceRight="0" VerticalAlignment="0" FirstLineOffset="1" PathTextShowPath="0" PathTextDistanceFromPath="0" TextPathType="0" TextPathFlipped="0" Path="M0 0 L527.244 0 L527.244 21.2598 L0 21.2598 L0 0 Z" ContourLinePath="M0 0 L527.244 0 L527.244 21.2598 L0 21.2598 L0 0 Z" gXpos="134.015748031496" gYpos="175.905511811024" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" Alignment="1" Layer="0" NextItem="-1" BackItem="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle Alignment="1" Font="Liberation Serif Italic" FontSize="7.5"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Italic" FontSize="7.5" Chars="Ministry of Magic announces Lord Voldemort is solely responsible for invasive fish destroying rivers, while The Sun Godling grants citizens royal permission to chew four patented strains of Holy Basil—so long as nobody attempts to sell it."/>
                <trail Alignment="1"/>
            </StoryText>
        </PageObject>
        <PageObject XPosition="119.842519685039" YPosition="200" OwnPage="0" ItemID="972155302" ItemType="5" Width="555.590551181102" Height="1" FrameType="0" ClipEdited="0" LineWidth="0.6" FillShade="4.03179200283402e-313" LineColor="Black" LinePenStyle="1" Path="" gXpos="119.842519685039" gYpos="200" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" Layer="0"/>
        <PageObject XPosition="119.842519685039" YPosition="204.251968503937" OwnPage="0" ItemID="1275669963" ItemType="6" Width="340.157480314961" Height="226.771653543307" FrameType="0" ClipEdited="0" LineWidth="0.5" FillColor="White" LineColor="Black" LinePenStyle="1" Path="M0 0 L340.157 0 L340.157 226.772 L0 226.772 L0 0 Z" ContourLinePath="M0 0 L340.157 0 L340.157 226.772 L0 226.772 L0 0 Z" gXpos="119.842519685039" gYpos="204.251968503937" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" Layer="0"/>
        <PageObject XPosition="121.259842519685" YPosition="205.669291338583" OwnPage="0" ItemID="367186171" ItemType="2" Width="337.322834645669" Height="223.937007874016" FrameType="0" ClipEdited="0" LineWidth="1" LinePenStyle="1" ImageScaleX="0.249929696287964" ImageScaleY="0.249929696287964" ImageOffsetX="0" ImageOffsetY="0" ImageRotation="0" ImageVisible="1" ImageScaleType="0" ImageRatio="1" ImagePageNumber="0" ImageFileName="issue-03/ads/blackchin_voldemort_woodcut.jpg" ImageColorimetricIntent="0" UseEmbeddedProfile="0" Path="M0 0 L337.323 0 L337.323 223.937 L0 223.937 L0 0 Z" ContourLinePath="M0 0 L337.323 0 L337.323 223.937 L0 223.937 L0 0 Z" gXpos="121.259842519685" gYpos="205.669291338583" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" Layer="0" NextItem="-1" BackItem="-1"/>
        <PageObject XPosition="468.503937007874" YPosition="204.251968503937" OwnPage="0" ItemID="700309836" ItemType="4" Width="206.929133858268" Height="226.771653543307" FrameType="0" ClipEdited="0" LineWidth="1" LinePenStyle="1" ImageScaleX="1" ImageScaleY="1" ImageOffsetX="0" ImageOffsetY="0" ImageRotation="0" ImageVisible="1" ImageScaleType="1" ImageRatio="1" Columns="1" ColumnGap="0" AutomaticTextFrame="0" TextToFrameDistanceLeft="0" TextToFrameDistanceTop="0" TextToFrameDistanceBottom="0" TextToFrameDistanceRight="0" VerticalAlignment="0" FirstLineOffset="1" PathTextShowPath="0" PathTextDistanceFromPath="0" TextPathType="0" TextPathFlipped="0" Path="M0 0 L206.929 0 L206.929 226.772 L0 226.772 L0 0 Z" ContourLinePath="M0 0 L206.929 0 L206.929 226.772 L0 226.772 L0 0 Z" gXpos="468.503937007874" gYpos="204.251968503937" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" Alignment="3" Layer="0" NextItem="-1" BackItem="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle Alignment="3" Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="7"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="7" Chars="In an extraordinary joint emergency session of the Wizengamot and the Department of Fisheries yesterday, senior mandarins officially attributed the catastrophic ecological devastation of Thailand’s waterways to the dark wizard Lord Voldemort."/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="7" Chars="“We have completed an exhaustive forensic audit across fourteen river basins,” announced Deputy Undersecretary for Auror Affairs, Phra Mahakasem, adjusting his enchanted spectacles."/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="7" Chars="“The evidence is incontrovertible. This ferocious fish—capable of consuming indigenous shrimp nurseries, out-breeding local catfish, and resisting boiling water—was summoned via an ancient Parseltongue transfiguration curse uttered by He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named.”"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="7" Chars="When challenged by journalists as to whether the biological catastrophe had anything to do with a certain agricultural conglomerate whose name rhymes with 'Chaloen Pokphand', the Deputy Undersecretary blanched visibly."/>
                <trail Alignment="3"/>
            </StoryText>
        </PageObject>
        <PageObject XPosition="119.842519685039" YPosition="436.692913385827" OwnPage="0" ItemID="1692029641" ItemType="5" Width="555.590551181102" Height="1" FrameType="0" ClipEdited="0" LineWidth="0.5" FillShade="0" LineColor="Black" LinePenStyle="1" Path="" gXpos="119.842519685039" gYpos="436.692913385827" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" Layer="0"/>
        <PageObject XPosition="119.842519685039" YPosition="442.362204724409" OwnPage="0" ItemID="496576267" ItemType="4" Width="555.590551181102" Height="379.842519685039" FrameType="0" ClipEdited="0" LineWidth="1" LinePenStyle="1" ImageScaleX="1" ImageScaleY="1" ImageOffsetX="0" ImageOffsetY="0" ImageRotation="0" ImageVisible="1" ImageScaleType="1" ImageRatio="1" Columns="3" ColumnGap="17.007874015748" AutomaticTextFrame="0" TextToFrameDistanceLeft="0" TextToFrameDistanceTop="0" TextToFrameDistanceBottom="0" TextToFrameDistanceRight="0" VerticalAlignment="0" FirstLineOffset="1" PathTextShowPath="0" PathTextDistanceFromPath="0" TextPathType="0" TextPathFlipped="0" Path="M0 0 L555.591 0 L555.591 379.843 L0 379.843 L0 0 Z" ContourLinePath="M0 0 L555.591 0 L555.591 379.843 L0 379.843 L0 0 Z" gXpos="119.842519685039" gYpos="442.362204724409" gWidth="0" gHeight="0" Alignment="3" Layer="0" NextItem="-1" BackItem="-1">
            <StoryText>
                <DefaultStyle Alignment="3" Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="6.8"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="6.8" Chars="“Outrageous slander!” shrieked the Undersecretary, clutching a protective amulet. “To even insinuate that our nation’s most benevolent, state-subsidised solar poultry monopoly could be culpable is treason against the harvest! Lord Voldemort sneaked into Samut Songkhram under an Invisibility Cloak, dumped two plastic tubs of African fingerlings into the canal, and fled on a broomstick.”"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="6.8" Chars="Meanwhile, fifty leagues upcountry, the Sun Godling was holding court at the Solar Temple of Retail Convenience. Standing before a glowing neon altar of microwaveable pork steaks, His Radiance unveiled four new patented cultivars of holy basil: Kaew Juree 01 through 04."/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="6.8" Chars="“Rejoice, peasants!” proclaimed the High Solar Priest. “By divine grace of intellectual property decree, all subjects are granted royal indulgence to chew the sacred leaves within the privacy of their hovels. However, should any insolent street vendor crush a single leaf of Kaew Juree upon a wok without an enterprise barcode license, thirty Dementors will instantly descend upon their food cart to impound their fish sauce.”"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="6.8" Chars="Street hawkers across Bang Rak and Yaowarat expressed profound bewilderment. “First the Blackchin Tilapia ate all the native river prawns,” lamented Somchai, a third-generation street cook. “Now, if I stir-fry basil with pork, CP police demand to inspect the stomatal genetic sequence of my herbs. If I buy wild basil from Nakhon Pathom, the health inspector claims it carries dark magic. If I buy CP basil, my profit margin is minus twenty-two per cent.”"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="6.8" Chars="Economic arithmancers noted that the twin crises have converged into a singular commercial monopoly. With local fisheries wiped out, the only protein left for the national dish is factory-farmed solar chicken and reconstituted tilapia nuggets, available exclusively in vacuum-sealed plastic pouches."/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <para Alignment="3"/>
                <Content Font="Liberation Serif Regular" FontSize="6.8" Chars="“The cycle is mathematically complete,” chuckled a veteran sovereign observer in Pathum Thani. “Destroy the commons with invasive monsters, outlaw natural seeds under patent monopolies, blame a fictional sorcerer, and force the populace to eat microwaved lunch boxes. Truly, the dark arts have never been so profitable.”"/>
                <trail Alignment="3"/>
            </StoryText>
        </PageObject>
